WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.750
The Moon has an atmosphere — just a very, very thin one.

2
00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:13.060
I skimmed close above the surface to taste it.

3
00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:18.770
Then I crashed on the far side, where nobody on Earth could watch.

4
00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:25.040
I tasted the Moon's thin air, then fell where I could harm no footprints.
